================================================================================
Bundled data
================================================================================

The following third-party material is redistributed inside this repository and
inside the published container image.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Public Suffix List
    src/Airside.Runtime/Dns/data/public_suffix_list.dat

    Source:  https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat
    Licence: Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0
             https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/

    Used to determine the registrable domain (eTLD+1) of a hostname, which is
    what Let's Encrypt counts certificate issuance against.

    Comments and blank lines have been stripped from the upstream file; the
    upstream VERSION line is retained in the header. No rule has been altered,
    added, or removed. The unmodified file is available from the URL above.

    This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License,
    v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this file, You can
    obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Cloudflare IP ranges
    src/Airside.Runtime/Dns/data/cloudflare_ranges.txt

    Source:  https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4
             https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v6

    Published by Cloudflare, Inc. as public network information. Used to detect
    a proxied ("orange-clouded") DNS record during domain pre-flight, so that a
    certificate challenge which cannot succeed is explained rather than
    attempted.

    Cloudflare is a trademark of Cloudflare, Inc. Airside is not affiliated with
    or endorsed by Cloudflare.


